cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or implement Local Model Access (LMA), please cite it as below."
title: "Local Model Access (LMA)"
abstract: >-
  A standard, with reference code, for one on-device AI model file shared by many websites. Model files are read as
  published (GGUF and safetensors, including split and sharded models), identified by their Hugging Face identity,
  approved by each site, verified once, and read in bounded slices without copies.
type: software
